---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<dialog class="cookie-modal" aria-labelledby="cookie-modal-title" data-cookie-modal>
  <form method="dialog" class="cookie-modal__inner" data-cookie-form>
    <div class="cookie-modal__head">
      <h2 id="cookie-modal-title">Configurar cookies</h2>
      <button type="button" class="cookie-modal__close" aria-label="Cerrar" data-cookie-close>
        <Icon name="close" size={22} />
      </button>
    </div>
    <p class="cookie-modal__intro">
      Elige qué cookies aceptas. Puedes cambiarlo cuando quieras desde "Configurar cookies" en el pie de la web.
    </p>

    <div class="cookie-cat">
      <div class="cookie-cat__row">
        <label for="cookie-necessary" class="cookie-cat__title">Necesarias</label>
        <span class="switch">
          <input type="checkbox" id="cookie-necessary" checked disabled aria-describedby="cookie-necessary-desc" />
          <span class="switch__track" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <p id="cookie-necessary-desc">Siempre activas. Guardan tu elección de cookies y hacen que la web funcione.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cookie-cat">
      <div class="cookie-cat__row">
        <label for="cookie-marketing" class="cookie-cat__title">Marketing · Píxel de Meta</label>
        <span class="switch">
          <input type="checkbox" id="cookie-marketing" name="marketing" aria-describedby="cookie-marketing-desc" data-cookie-marketing />
          <span class="switch__track" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <p id="cookie-marketing-desc">
        Nos dicen qué anuncios de Instagram y Facebook funcionan para mostrarte menos publicidad que no te interesa.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cookie-modal__actions">
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn--block" data-cookie-save>Guardar preferencias</button>
      <a href="/cookies" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="link">Política de cookies</a>
    </div>
  </form>
</dialog>

<style>
  .cookie-modal {
    width: min(520px, calc(100% - 24px));
    max-height: calc(100dvh - 24px);
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--white);
    color: var(--ink);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px -24px rgb(30 21 48 / 0.5);
    overflow: auto;
  }
  .cookie-modal::backdrop {
    background: rgb(30 21 48 / 0.55);
  }
  .cookie-modal__inner {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .cookie-modal__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .cookie-modal__head h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
  }
  .cookie-modal__close {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    margin-right: -10px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .cookie-modal__close:hover {
    background: var(--lilac-50);
  }
  .cookie-modal__intro,
  .cookie-cat p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
  }
  .cookie-cat {
    padding: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }
  .cookie-cat__row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .cookie-cat__title {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .switch {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    width: 52px;
    height: 32px;
    flex: none;
  }
  .switch input {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -6px;
    width: calc(100% + 12px);
    height: calc(100% + 12px);
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .switch input:disabled {
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  .switch__track {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #cfc7dd;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .switch__track::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 4px;
    left: 4px;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--white);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgb(30 21 48 / 0.3);
    transition: transform 0.2s var(--ease);
  }
  .switch input:checked + .switch__track {
    background: var(--purple);
  }
  .switch input:checked + .switch__track::after {
    transform: translateX(20px);
  }
  .switch input:disabled + .switch__track {
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .switch input:focus-visible + .switch__track {
    outline: 3px solid var(--purple);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .cookie-modal__actions {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }
</style>
